    "title": "UAS Holds Inaugural Pride Prom - NewsBreak",
    "text": "uaswhalesong.com\nwebsite\nJuneau\nUAS Holds Inaugural Pride Prom\nBy UASWhalesong,\n3 hours agoIn honor of National Coming Out Day, the UAS Juneau Campus held its first-ever Pride Prom on Oct. 11 at the Rec Center. The joyful and exciting event was full of good music, smiles, and food, with many of the attendees taking advantage of the photobooth. Groups of friends old and new gathered for pictures, showing off glamorous outfits, goofy poses, and sparkling smiles.\n1",
